{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43266","headline":"登云梯 · 殷琮","name":"登云梯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧落远澄澄，青山路可昇。\n身轻疑易蹋，步独觉难凭。\n逦迤排将近，回翔势渐登。\n上宁愁屈曲，高更喜超腾。\n江树遥分蔼，山岚宛若凝。\n赤城容许到，敢惮百千层。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷琮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}